            "review_title": "Review at Ha Giang Wings Bungalow Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Anouk H\n8 contributions\n0\nNice place!\nOct 2023 • Couples\nSuper nice place to stay! Clean accommodation, nice swimming pool and good food! The people are very nice and nothing is too much to ask. Booked a private tour for the Ha Giang Loop through Wings, definitely recommended! Then she took us (for free) to our bus stop further in the center.\nIf you come for the peace and quiet, go here!\nShow original\nWritten October 26, 2023",
