            "review_title": "Review at Ha Giang Wings Bungalow Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Qudeer\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nExceptional Service at Ha Giang Wings Bungalow\nOct 2023 • Family\nDuring our memorable loop trip, we had the pleasure of staying at Ha Giang Wings Bungalow, and it was a truly wonderful experience. Tuyet, the ageless manager, was incredibly warm and welcoming, as was her entire team. We highly recommend this place. Tuyet also assisted us in organizing the loop before our arrival, and her support was nothing short of exceptional. \n\nA special thanks to Tuyet and the entire team for their hospitality, and we greatly appreciated the snacks they kindly gifted us for our journey back to Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 23, 2023",
